; AlgoX SuperTrend Pro EA - preset C3_CostGates_Only
; Control: original score engine plus the cost gates only
; family: cost | hard filters: none
; The control group: the original score engine (fib 25 / structure 30 / EMA 25 / RSI 20) with no extra indicator block, but with the cost gates and the TP2 + break-even exit. The difference against 00_Pine_Baseline isolates how much of the improvement comes from the geometry alone (target size, ATR and ADX gates) instead of the filters.
; Generated by generate_presets.py - do not edit by hand.
; Copy to MQL4/Presets and load it from the Inputs tab (Load button).
; Coherence rules: max 2 hard filters per family, max 5 in total,
; everything else inside a family stays on score so the filters do not fight each other.

